        "text": "I'm hiring! \ud83d\ude80\n\nOur Frontier Health team at @GoogleDeepMind is looking for a Research Scientist to build foundational AI &amp; physiological world models for human biology.\n\nHelp us transform healthcare from reactive observation to proactive intervention. \ud83e\uddec\n\n\ud83d\udd17 Apply:",
