      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/agarwl_/status/2093444511129362849",
      "text": "In our training runs, KL divergence between a bf16 Kimi K3 training forward pass and a bf16 Kimi K3 inference engine was approximately the same as the mismatch between a bf16 Kimi K3 trainer and an MXFP4 Kimi K3 inference engine\" \ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udc40",
